# Running Python

Use `uv` from the project root; do not activate `.venv` or call `python` directly. Source lives under `src/` (`elephant_id`).

```bash
cd /path/to/elephant-id
uv run python path/to/script.py
uv run python -m elephant_id.module
uv run pytest
uv sync
uv sync --extra visualization --extra local
```
